Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:11.86,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,This is your "special place"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:12.74,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:16.49,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,The place you can get the most excited\Nand power up the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:17.91,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:25.74,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, class is starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:26.83,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:28.00,HybridMain,All,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:29.21,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Class?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:31.01,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:34.68,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:38.01,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,We're in the middle of class, \Nso you should be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:40.56,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,S-Stop it...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:44.02,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Not here! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:46.02,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:48.02,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What if they notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:50.65,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,"What if they notice"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:53.90,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Just don't do this, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:55.53,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.07,0:00:58.07,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You're kidding...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:00.87,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.03,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,This is the finishing blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.09,0:01:18.80,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Next is Chidorigafuchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:25.06,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:26.81,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,N-Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:31.69,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! They'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:33.57,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, solve the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:35.15,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.49,0:01:37.86,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:39.66,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Is she not wearing panties?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:40.57,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.41,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody's watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:45.16,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,So is Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.95,0:01:47.92,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,So why...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.58,0:01:50.58,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I so excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.09,0:01:52.54,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Why do I feel so good?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.46,0:01:59.09,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Unimaginable embarrassment \Nwill bring out Aine's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:10.48,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, that's all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:19.61,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You're such a dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:21.12,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I was so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.12,0:02:23.03,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:24.37,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:29.12,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:08.93,Episode,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,750)}Episode 13
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:08.93,Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(460,750)}Aine -Aines-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:09.68,HybridTop,H,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't Aine-san and Kizuna-kun\Ntaking a little too long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:11.93,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,You don't get to talk, Hayuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.93,0:04:13.64,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:15.77,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia, how's it going over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:19.40,HybridItalics,S,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, stop it, Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:20.44,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:23.32,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That girl is having a very nice dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:25.95,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:28.58,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Is it finally time for the last boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:34.42,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Neros and Kuros?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:38.59,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It seems you've been giving our\Nexpeditionary forces a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:42.13,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,So I'll let you have a very special dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.43,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Heart Rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:50.26,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I-I was trying to hold back my embarrassment,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:51.85,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,and now I'm at my limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.94,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,If I move, it's going to drip out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:55.94,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:57.86,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,So let me go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:00.86,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:02.15,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.04,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:19.88,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I brought them all here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:23.71,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...to watch you Climax Hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:25.80,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:27.26,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:30.93,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.64,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.35,0:05:35.14,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,S...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:36.98,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,S-Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:40.19,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look! Don't look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:44.32,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This is too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:49.66,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Any more and I won't be able to hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:52.15,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:54.50,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Expose your true self.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:56.04,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I-I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.54,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Too embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:00.29,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:01.92,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:03.42,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.09,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:12.43,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:15.18,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:16.56,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Climax Hybrid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.15,0:06:30.16,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:33.58,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...the light of my Immoral Weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:43.54,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:46.05,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:51.68,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine? Hang in there, Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:54.97,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:58.39,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.39,0:06:59.69,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:03.11,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,My hair's still silver?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:05.69,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Did the Climax Hybrid fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:07.94,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:10.70,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I thought it would work for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:13.16,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:13.95,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.74,0:07:17.75,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I was about to get this incredible power,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:19.87,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,but I was too scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:22.42,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Don't blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:23.71,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:25.29,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:35.89,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:37.39,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:42.65,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Himekawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:44.40,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Yurishia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.15,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Sylvia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:48.15,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:49.86,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:54.16,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Captain of the Batlantis Empire's \NRoyal Guards, Zelshione.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:58.08,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Your cries won't reach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:04.08,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Their souls are currently floating \Ndeep within their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:05.67,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:10.30,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Where am I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.17,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you, everyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:21.31,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Tri-Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:26.69,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're so awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:30.03,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't you save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:32.65,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't want to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.99,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:37.66,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:40.70,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:44.71,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I tried t-to save you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:50.75,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Just hang in there, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.30,0:08:52.92,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:55.37,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:04.48,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,N... No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:12.53,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Scarlet...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:16.20,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.41,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:21.73,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,They're swallowed up by a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:27.12,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,A past that might have been, \Nfilled with pain and regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:28.46,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:30.84,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,So a psychological attack, basically?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:34.01,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,A cowardly, shameful way of fighting \Nwithout getting your hands dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:39.68,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Your complaints don't even reach my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:42.75,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You never had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:51.02,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Scarlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:52.52,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Sharon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.94,0:09:54.11,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Henrietta!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:55.82,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:58.20,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The bitches aren't answering me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:00.95,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.95,0:10:01.78,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Reiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:06.33,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,A new Magitech weapon attack on Area 11!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:07.96,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Counterattack system crippled!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:15.46,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll show you what the Masters can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:17.92,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Up our pay while you're at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:23.01,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there, and Amaterasu will...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:26.48,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The Eros Overlord will do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.02,0:10:29.94,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,If you surrender to the Batlantis Empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:31.73,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll spare your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:32.77,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.77,0:10:34.86,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Even you Lemurians have value...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:39.49,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,...as cattle for harvesting life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:42.99,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,How about it? I promise you a happy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.83,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:51.58,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,How could I be happy if \NI stopped being myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.79,0:10:53.00,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:58.51,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That girl doesn't seem to \Nknow who she is, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:02.59,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you get the Zeros core?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.22,0:11:05.47,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you've forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:06.77,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.10,0:11:09.60,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,It's got nothing to do with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:12.10,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I knew I wouldn't tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:16.40,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:17.36,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:19.35,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:24.03,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,...I'll have you go find where you got it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:27.91,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,by going back through your own memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:41.55,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Bring back Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:45.05,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Bring back everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:49.06,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're just a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:53.05,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you think you could lay a finger on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:54.73,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make you pay...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:56.81,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make you pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:11:59.90,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Eros!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:17.21,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Where am I supposed to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.54,0:12:19.96,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to look for the core, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.80,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:24.80,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I'm here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:34.44,HybridFlashback,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:37.19,HybridFlashback,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,So the core's already been installed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:42.36,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Already been installed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:57.58,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:01.46,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:04.68,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.68,0:13:05.72,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:09.30,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I should've known an \Nincomplete Climax Hybrid
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:10.72,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,wouldn't give me enough power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:15.73,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,He fights for those he loves?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:18.90,HybridItalics,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,How long will he last?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.99,0:13:27.61,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:31.62,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:37.83,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Are you really sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:42.13,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,The truth lies beyond this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:45.55,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But once you open it, there's no going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:47.13,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.43,0:13:48.64,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:53.18,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:56.06,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:09.66,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not done yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:16.57,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:20.71,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Zeros Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:38.44,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Bring everyone back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:40.98,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,How interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.98,0:14:43.57,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I had no idea such a Magitech armor existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:46.82,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have to take my time \Ninvestigating it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:58.54,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,A man's screams can be pretty pleasant, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.88,0:15:12.22,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,This was at least a little entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:14.26,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not done yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:17.56,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,I swore I'd save them all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:20.23,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,That I wouldn't let them die...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:23.52,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,That I'd protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:25.48,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,And that's why I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.65,0:15:28.65,HybridFlashback,R,0000,0000,0000,,You're not needed anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:30.82,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:39.37,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:46.88,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:49.55,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,You're always with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:53.43,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,We're with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.84,0:15:56.56,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,So feel us as much as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:01.98,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Please use Sylvia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:04.48,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Now, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:10.90,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't know when to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:13.11,HybridItalics,H,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:14.07,HybridItalics,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.07,0:16:15.16,HybridItalics,S,0000,0000,0000,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:18.45,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Eros!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:57.45,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:17:00.12,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Amaterasu Mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:04.96,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Eros's Hybrid Count is rising!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:07.46,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,That sumbitch Kizuna's in top form!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:10.09,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,But he hasn't done a Heart Hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:13.01,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Pleasure and excitement \Nwithout even touching?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:15.47,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Ecstasy that goes beyond the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.30,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Carnality between minds \Ncalling to one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:20.97,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,This is the ultimate form of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.96,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,A miracle has just occurred!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.19,0:17:26.23,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.19,0:17:31.15,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Neros!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.33,0:17:40.03,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Kuros!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:45.16,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Taros!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:50.84,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.34,0:18:00.26,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,You're all that's left!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.18,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.23,0:18:10.98,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,How about some last words after that scream—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:14.19,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I laid more than a finger on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:22.37,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:25.95,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you do that to my Teros?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:30.21,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.29,0:18:32.38,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.80,0:18:37.42,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,When...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:41.89,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You're the first person to push me this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:44.68,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give you my praise for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:50.60,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,As a reward,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:53.11,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have her finish you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.41,0:19:01.07,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Aine...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:05.58,HybridFlashback,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'll think about it with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:08.54,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:12.21,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna was protecting me, even then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.80,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,But I got scared and ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:17.67,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:27.31,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.44,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,No! This isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:31.06,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.56,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:36.32,HybridMain,H,0000,0000,0000,,Aine-san, what are you—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:39.81,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! Aine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.99,0:19:42.57,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.87,0:19:45.57,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna! Kizuna! Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:47.83,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I want to feel you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:50.33,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,With my hands, with my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:51.58,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,with everything I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:53.33,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hold you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:55.34,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,I want to become one with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:58.51,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,So I want power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:02.51,HybridItalics,A,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:10.48,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:12.90,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,She's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:17.52,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Zeros.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:24.49,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.74,0:20:30.16,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Th-The Forbidden...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.25,0:20:40.09,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:45.05,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.01,0:20:48.56,HybridItalics,K,0000,0000,0000,,...protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.74,0:21:10.33,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Code Breaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:17.63,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,My Gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.03,0:21:22.46,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,I-I can't go down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:39.69,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:41.23,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The sealing system!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:43.72,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Th-The magical power is disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:47.49,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The Magitech signal of the \NEntrance is dropping rapidly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:50.23,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The sealing system is activating!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:22:00.99,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The Entrance is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.24,0:22:03.50,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,The operation was a goddamn success!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.63,0:22:09.90,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:11.70,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Reiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:14.12,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.19,0:22:17.14,HybridMain,R,0000,0000,0000,,You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:24.20,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Nayuta-sama, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.67,0:22:27.22,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Well done, Aine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.65,0:22:31.48,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Now we can proceed to\Nthe next phase of the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.97,0:22:34.04,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:35.80,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.02,0:22:37.04,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:38.81,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:40.65,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.31,0:22:42.74,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Aine-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.14,0:22:44.86,HybridMain,Y,0000,0000,0000,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:46.21,HybridMain,S,0000,0000,0000,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.21,0:22:47.47,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:22:55.41,HybridMain,K,0000,0000,0000,,It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.02,0:22:57.17,HybridMain,A,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.45,0:23:24.78,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Princess of the Batlantis Empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.99,0:23:27.13,HybridMain,,0000,0000,0000,,Aines Sinclavia.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.29,0:23:31.73,HybridMain,Gi,0000,0000,0000,,Sister!
